# SCHVIZ2

## Example Usage

```
var schviz = new SCHVIZ(parent : DOMNode);

schviz.renderSCJSON(parent : DOMNode, jsonDoc : scjson, function(err, layout){})
schviz.renderKgraph(parent : DOMNode, kgraph : kgraphJson, function(err, layout){})
```

